            "author_association": "MEMBER",
            "body": "> The fix might be simpler:\r\n\r\nHmm... If that is the case, that's great. It's just *slightly* suspicious that this order works, since the logical order of things is \"first show message, then ensure it is shown by redraw\". But Vim screen drawing might have some parts that don't look logical at first. I'll need to take a closer look, since that order was chosen for (some) reason.",
