        {
            "author_association": "MEMBER",
            "body": "This should now be resolved on the latest `main`. I remembered that I wanted to replace the whole `:echo '' | redraw` with a single `:mode` (which seems to do just that, but with a rather non-descriptive name). This reduces code and makes Neovim>=0.13 tests work again.\r\n\r\nThanks for finding the culprit. It made finding the solution much easier :)",
